fects. Added rewards that let you choose legendary equipment. Improved the readability of skill descriptions, status icons, and damage numbers. Improved window placement, dragging, and visual effect settings, and fixed various bugs. Note: Previously spent growth points will be refunded as part of the progression overhaul, allowing you to allocate them again.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:32:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687389","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5171740-1845383656395547","game_id":"steam-5171740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — UI and Guidance Improvements","summary":"Improved window, button, tab and tooltip designs and text readability. Enlarged the familiar window by 25% and made familiar information and trait descriptions easier to read. Improved the first skill tutorial and guidance for equipping movement skills. Fixed Thunderbolt sound effect timing and shield display issues on the health bar. Added rarity colors to the Sealstone Auto Dismantle and equipment dismantling screens.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T07:51:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5171740-1845383656390942","game_id":"steam-5171740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — Dedicated Support Skill Slot and UI Improvements","summary":"Added a dedicated support skill slot. (3 attack skills + 1 support skill) Improved cooldown behavior when switching skills. Unequipped skills now pause their cooldowns and resume them when equipped again. Improved the dismantling, inventory, and stash UI.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T10:25:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390942","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5171740-1845383656389676","game_id":"steam-5171740","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — More Legendary Effects and Bug Fixes","summary":"Hello, Hunters! We've expanded the demo's selection of Legendary effects so you can try more gear combinations, and fixed a few issues found during play. New Content - Added 30 Legendary effects from the full game to the demo. - The demo now features 68 Legendary effects, giving you more ways to combine gear and skills in your builds. Bug Fixes - Fixed an issue where auras on some elite and boss monsters remained visible while the game was hidden. - You can now freely drag the display toggle but","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T17:57:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5171740-1845383656387511","game_id":"steam-5171740","kind":"announcement","title":"Desk Hunter Demo is now available!","summary":"The free Desk Hunter demo is now available on Steam! Desk Hunter is a single-player idle RPG that lives in a compact window on your desktop. Let your hunter battle while you do other things, then check in to collect gear, choose skills, and try different builds. When you need more space, you can collapse the window to the size of a single button. In the demo, you can explore: 30 Normal stages, from 1-1 through 3-10 Hunter progression up to level 30 Equipment collection, enhancement, and random r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T19:31:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5171740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5171740":"2026-10-26T09:08:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5171740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:08Z"},"5219640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:08:09Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5171740","app_id":5171740,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:39Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"70c2c2dce03dd0f7541cdb28ae3da6a4e57608e7b378706c375a84c3f4642796","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Desk Hunter는 작은 창에서 계속 전투를 펼치는 데스크톱 방치형 RPG입니다. 전리품을 모아 장비 연금술로 장비를 다듬고, 스킬과 성장 노드로 빌드를 구성하며, 사역마와 함께 더 높은 난이도에 도전하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Corner Forge"}],"developers":[{"name":"Corner Forge"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Desk Hunter - Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792134752","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5171740/1868593612/9770462e3971818c8dad33d68ca540951c7d16c1/1792134448/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5171740/1868593612/9770462e3971818c8dad33d68ca540951c7d16c1/1792134